{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/brainrotkart.gif?t=1751312560\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brainrot Kart</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer kart racing game</strong> where players compete in fast-paced, chaotic races. Choose from a variety of outrageous maps like <strong>&quot;Gooning Gateway&quot;</strong> and use unique items such as a <strong>Hawk Tuah ball</strong> to attack and sabotage other players. Show off your wild karts to your bros, including <strong>Quandale Dingle</strong> and <strong>Skibidi Toilet</strong>, each offering different kart stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brainrot Kart Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rizzy Brainrot Kart Action: Tear through chaotic maps and unleash wild items like the Hawk Tuah Ball</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8-Player Multiplayer: Race and brainrot with your homies!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Goated Karts: Choose from cracked options like Quandale Dingle and Skibidi Toilet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Doesn't cost $80 like other kart games</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost your rizz by karting with the squad, or go solo to dominate every Brainrot track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race, Rizz, Goon, Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/gyat.gif?t=1751312560\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411440?t=1751312560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411440?t=1751312560","capsule_